  "title": "Headless build in Brett's AmberX-AXF repo (worktree, branch claude/review-schema).",
  "asked": "Headless build in Brett's AmberX-AXF repo (worktree, branch claude/review-schema). Read CLAUDE.md + _claude/shared/rules/RULES.md. Opus, one session. Git auth is in your environment (GIT_CONFIG_*); just git push. 0. Wait (poll every 30 s, max 90 min) until origin/main contains the shot-groups build (git log origin/main --oneline | grep -i 'shot-groups\\|named.*group', or origin/claude/shot-groups is an ancestor). Then git merge origin/main. Brett's rule: ANYTHING that goes into UI Review (the approve/reject queue AND Screenshots), from ANY source (Claude chat or voice, agents, headless builds, console, plugins, manual uploads) MUST have a NAME and a TIMESTAMP and conform to ONE schema. No exceptions. 1. framework/schemas: ui-review-item@1 (asset@1-style envelope): required id, name (non-empty, human), group (name + id), createdAt (ISO timestamp), kind (review|screenshot), source (claude-chat|claude-voice|claude-code|headless|agent|console|plugin|manual|watch-live), submittedBy (session/build/agent/user), app, screen/route, viewport, files (before/after), status (review items: pending|approved|rejected|changes), optional note, pr, build/step ids. Plus ui-review-group@1. 2. Validate at EVERY intake path (server API, framework/cli/shot.mjs, build/orchestrator review hooks, plugin submit helpers, AmberX upload): non-conforming -> rejected with a clear message naming the missing field; no silent defaults except createdAt=now and auto group name '<source/session> - <date time>' when a caller can't ask Brett. 3. Migrate every existing UI Review item + screenshot to the schema (fill names from titles, timestamps from file times, groups by build/day); dry-run report first. 4. CI check: fixtures + any code that submits to UI Review must build schema-valid items. 5. RULES.md: one line restating the rule (Claude asks Brett for the group name before sending on his behalf). Tests (validation rejects missing name/timestamp, every intake path validated, migration). Full local test block from .github/workflows/android.yml + theme/controls/lifecycle checks green. Commit, fetch+merge origin/main, retest, git push origin HEAD:main (retry until it lands). Report at _claude/builds/reports/review-schema.md.",
